<Base title="Privacy and your data — ClaimClock"><div class="wrap narrow prose"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR RECORD. YOUR CHOICE.</p><h1>Privacy & your data / गोपनीयता</h1><p>Your hospital timeline is saved in this browser's local storage. Your documents are read on this device. Clearing browser data removes local records; shared-device users may be able to see them. No login, third-party analytics or advertising scripts.</p><p>आपका घटनाक्रम इस ब्राउज़र में रहता है। दस्तावेज़ इसी डिवाइस पर पढ़े जाते हैं। ब्राउज़र का डेटा मिटाने से स्थानीय रिकॉर्ड भी मिटेगा। साझा डिवाइस पर दूसरे लोग उसे देख सकते हैं।</p><h2>What leaves the device / क्या बाहर जाता है</h2><ul><li><strong>Copy, WhatsApp or email:</strong> you choose the recipient and send the message. / प्राप्तकर्ता चुनकर आप संदेश भेजते हैं।</li><li><strong>Explain with AI:</strong> only the redacted text you preview is sent through our Cloudflare Worker to the configured provider. No file is uploaded. Automated redaction can miss names; check the preview. The app does not store AI text on the server; the provider's own retention terms apply. / AI के लिए केवल आपके जाँचे हुए चुने पाठ को भेजा जाता है। नाम छूट सकता है; प्रीव्यू जाँचें। प्रदाता की अपनी डेटा नीति लागू होती है।</li><li><strong>Optional patient reports:</strong> insurer, TPA, city, request type, submission/decision times and outcome are stored in Cloudflare D1 for up to 365 days. Purpose: publish grouped discharge waiting-time research. No hospital name, name, policy number, document, IP or user-agent is stored by the app. / स्वैच्छिक रिपोर्ट केवल समूह के देरी आँकड़ों के लिए है।</li></ul><p>Cloudflare and your network necessarily process connection metadata to deliver the service. ClaimClock's application logs are disabled. Browser-only storage is not encrypted by ClaimClock.</p><h2>Publication and withdrawal / प्रकाशन और वापसी</h2><p>We publish only grouped cells with at least ten reports. We do not publish exact timestamps, individual cities or hospital names. Closed monthly groups are used to reduce the chance of identifying someone. Erasing a report also withdraws the affected public group; raw reports expire after one year.</p><p>केवल कम से कम 10 रिपोर्ट वाले समूह दिखते हैं। व्यक्तिगत समय या अस्पताल नहीं दिखते। रिपोर्ट हटाने पर संबंधित सार्वजनिक समूह भी हटता है।</p><p>Keep the deletion code given after submission. It is the proof needed to erase your report without collecting your identity. If you lose it, we cannot reliably identify the report; the retention period still applies. Erasure cannot recall copies someone already downloaded.</p><form id="erase-report" class="card form-grid"><label class="full">Deletion code / हटाने का कोड<input name="code" required autocomplete="off" placeholder="report-id:deletion-token" maxlength="200" /></label><button class="button-secondary full" disabled>Erase my submitted report / मेरी रिपोर्ट हटाएँ</button><p id="erase-status" class="status full" role="status"></p></form><h2>Optional usage counts / वैकल्पिक उपयोग आँकड़े</h2><p>Only five counters: session started, clock-lock copied, escalation copied, delay-charge letter generated, opt-in submitted. No user identifier. Counts expire after 90 days; failed batches are dropped.</p><label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" id="analytics-consent" /><span>Share these anonymous usage counts to improve ClaimClock. Optional; off by default. / ऐप सुधारने के लिए ये अनाम आँकड़े साझा करें। वैकल्पिक; पहले से बंद।</span></label><h2>Local controls / डिवाइस पर नियंत्रण</h2><p><a href="/">Return to your timeline</a> to export it or delete it from this device. Closing a deduction page discards document text from the page; selected files are not persisted by the app.</p><h2>Contact and incidents</h2><p>Maintainer: Ketan Gautam. Privacy requests: <a href="mailto:ketangautam952@gmail.com">ketangautam952@gmail.com</a>. Send no medical documents. The <a href="https://github.com/ketan952/claimclock/blob/main/docs/privacy-operations.md">incident procedure</a> covers prompt notification, a 72-hour report process, containment and erasure. This is a privacy design, not a certification of DPDP compliance.</p><p class="fine-print">Notice version: 2026-10-10. Patient reporting is for adults 18+.</p></div><script>import '../lib/privacy';</script></Base>
